license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Echo-Memory is a controlled study of memory mechanisms in action-conditioned
  world models. It holds the Wan video backbone, training recipe, and evaluation
  protocol fixed, and compares Context, Compression, Spatial, and State-Space
  memory on replay, in-domain revisit, and open-domain return.
keywords:
  - world models
  - video generation
  - memory
  - action-conditioned
  - spatial memory
  - state-space models
